Package: ednaviz
Title: eDNA Metabarcoding Visualization App
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Joaquin", "Auzenne", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Interactive Shiny application for visualizing mammalian eDNA
    metabarcoding results. Accepts BLAST output in web CSV or CLI TSV format,
    applies LCA taxonomy assignment, and renders IUCN range polygons plus
    GBIF occurrence points on an interactive Leaflet map.
